WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.225
A tissue is a group of similar cells doing one job together.

2
00:00:05.101 --> 00:00:08.276
One muscle cell can only pull a tiny amount.

3
00:00:11.328 --> 00:00:15.403
Millions together make muscle tissue, strong enough to pump blood.

4
00:00:18.655 --> 00:00:23.330
Lining cells together make epithelial tissue, a smooth layer for blood.
